Z||000000||GodSend||09-08-2000||12:01 PM||||  Being a month old fiero owner now I have an observation about my fiero Gt , Actually, its an observation about how others view it.<P>  It turns alot of heads, no matter where you go.  I have lightly challenged several cars at lights (a few Talon TSi's, a couple of mustangs... the normal run of the mill).  Its hard to get a taker, even if they could lay the smack down on me.<P>  I have a feeling that what people expect from a fiero is the tradition notchback that is "slow and catches on fire".  If only they knew it was "just another fiero".. Just an observation  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>And now my question - This is VERY important.  What kind/type/smell of air freshener do you use? - Use a coconut one, smells great, really suits the car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.hypernetcommunications.com/revn.gif"> ||||reg||6
